WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.440
You cannot trust the things of this&nbsp;
world that always let you down.&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.680
You cannot trust in yourself.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.360
Because you're not perfect and&nbsp;
you will always make mistakes.&nbsp;

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.100
And you cannot trust in other people&nbsp;
because they always let you down.&nbsp;

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:23.160
But if your confidence is in God,&nbsp;
you will always have peace and joy.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.180
Hey guys,
Have you ever seen mature Christian men, and man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:39.420
it just looks like nothing can get this guy down.
How do you become like that?&nbsp;

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.140
How how does he do it?
They just act in strength - they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.580
always walk - talk and act - in boldness.
And with a lot of confidence.&nbsp;

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.440
So how do they do it?
And where does this confidence come from?&nbsp;

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:57.000
Well, it is not self-confidence.
It is God confidence.&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.540
And today, I want to talk to you about this&nbsp;
very important distinction that I believe every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:09.180
Christian man should know - the difference&nbsp;
between self-confidence and God confidence.&nbsp;

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:17.160
In your life, it can be natural, normal for you&nbsp;
to rely on your own human abilities and strengths.&nbsp;

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:22.860
But that is also where your power will end.
And that's pretty sad.&nbsp;

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:28.200
But as reborn Christians, we are&nbsp;
called to rely on God's strength.&nbsp;

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.140
His power.
And not our own.&nbsp;

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:36.000
We are called to place our confidence&nbsp;
in God and not in ourselves.&nbsp;

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.880
Because there is where we will get&nbsp;
more power to be able to overcome&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.440
things that we will never be able to&nbsp;
overcome with just our own human power.&nbsp;

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:53.580
Our abilities come from Him in the first place.
But He can do a lot more than our abilities.&nbsp;

00:01:53.580 --> 00:02:00.540
He gives us - equips us - with what&nbsp;
we need to accomplish His will - so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:06.060
we don't just need to rely on ourselves.
If you understand it and if you obey it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:12.420
your whole life will change because you understand&nbsp;
that there is nothing in this temporary world that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.280
can overcome you.
Why?&nbsp;

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:22.140
Because the God of the universe - I mean He&nbsp;
spoke the whole universe into existence. Man...&nbsp;

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.380
He is not limited by anything.
Not by time, space, matter, or anything at all.&nbsp;

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:36.540
God is in your corner and He will fight with you.
Not only with you, but for you.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.620
[1 John 4:4]

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.920
Self-confidence is not totally wrong.
If you understand it in the correct way.&nbsp;

00:02:52.920 --> 00:03:00.120
Understanding who you are - who God made you to&nbsp;
be - being content with your identity in Christ.&nbsp;

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:06.540
Then that is okay to understand&nbsp;
it, but still as human beings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:10.920
our own strength is limited.
Your human abilities are limited.&nbsp;

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:16.800
And your confidence in yourself can fall&nbsp;
especially when faced with challenges that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.000
are beyond your control, which&nbsp;
usually happens in this world.&nbsp;

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:28.920
But as reborn Christians, we are not alone.
So why do you keep on living and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:34.980
fighting as if you are on your own?
As a reborn Christian in your body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.360
which is the temple of God, you&nbsp;
have received the Spirit of God.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:40.920
[Romans 8:9]

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:52.800
If in fact the spirit of God dwells&nbsp;
in you, anyone who does not have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.800 --> 00:04:00.060
the Spirit of Christ does not belong to Him.
So when you stop looking at yourself all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:03.060
time, trying to have self-confidence,&nbsp;
placing your trust, your confidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:10.140
relying on yourself, and you take that out and you&nbsp;
place it in Christ, it changes everything for you.&nbsp;

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:16.800
Because now you tap into His limitless power.
Love.&nbsp;

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.660
Peace.
All the spiritual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:26.160
blessings we have already received in Christ.
We only need to access it and then doing it the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.900
right way through the power of the Holy Spirit,&nbsp;
the Holy Spirit will now help you and guide you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:37.860
your emotions, your intellect, your&nbsp;
own will to act within the will of God.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:45.180
Do you understand what I'm saying?
The will of God will flow through you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:50.160
towards the outside world.
God's blessing will be upon you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:57.420
if you act within the will of God, meaning if you&nbsp;
walk within the Spirit, you have nothing to fear.&nbsp;

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.840
Nothing at all.
The evil in this world, everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:07.500
in this world, temporary (that's temporary).
God has already overcome this world and you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:13.920
have overcome it through Christ that is in you.
So when you act within the power of God through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.740
His Spirit, everything will&nbsp;
work out the way it should.&nbsp;

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.780
And He will help you in your&nbsp;
weakness, even when you pray to God.&nbsp;

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:26.220
When there are times when you're not sure&nbsp;
exactly what to pray, He will help you.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.720
[Romans 8:26]

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:51.420
We walk boldly in faith with power trusting&nbsp;
God in everything, every aspect of our lives.&nbsp;

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:55.560
So if you pray, God, what is my purpose?
What do you want me to do with my life?&nbsp;

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:00.960
And if He talks to you through the Rhema word&nbsp;
and He says that you have to study theology to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:07.140
become a preacher, then you do it, trusting Him&nbsp;
knowing that He will give you what you need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:12.120
study Theology, and also after that you can pray&nbsp;
and say alright God, now I've studied Theology,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.520
I'm ready to become a preacher.
Where do you want me to go?&nbsp;

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.560
To what church?
How do you want me to do this?&nbsp;

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:22.080
He talks to you and then you act&nbsp;
according to what He says you need to do.&nbsp;

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:29.580
If He says you need to go and marry Mary.
Then you do it if He says do this.&nbsp;

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.160
You do it if He says do that.
You do it.&nbsp;

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.560
You walk according to His will.
You trust that He will help you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:40.620
will be there guiding you, but He will also give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:46.380
you - equip you - with what you need&nbsp;
to accomplish His will for your life.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.520
[John 14:21]

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:08.220
Jesus also said that man will not live by bread&nbsp;
alone but by every word of God, right? But that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:13.200
word is not the Logos word, that is the Rhema.
That is what God communicates to you.&nbsp;

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:18.060
You need to understand this - so the Logos -&nbsp;
the Word is - is the Word that God has already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.340
revealed to us.
The Bible.&nbsp;

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:24.240
But then He also speaks to us through&nbsp;
the Rhema, through the Holy Spirit.&nbsp;

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:28.860
So in the Bible when you read it,&nbsp;
it doesn't say go and marry Mary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:34.320
or do this or do that and call you by name.
But that is what He does through the Rhema word.&nbsp;

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:38.880
That's how He guides you in your&nbsp;
temporary life that you are living in now.&nbsp;

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:45.000
Specifically telling you to do specific things.
And then you walk in that Rhema word.&nbsp;

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.960
So you see, God will not just&nbsp;
help you with the Logos word,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:54.480
but also the Rhema word through the Holy&nbsp;
Spirit that is in you, guiding you every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.480 --> 00:08:01.020
step of the way in your life, every day, if&nbsp;
you trust Him, and if you let Him lead you.&nbsp;

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:05.220
Now, take this verse, write&nbsp;
it on your heart, and live it.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:08.640
[Philippians 4:13] Amplified version.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:43.740
Wow, man, this is amazing.
You know, there are so many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:47.820
self-improvement coaches in this world.
And it works a little bit.&nbsp;

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.720
But it doesn't really bring a lasting change.
Why not?&nbsp;

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:59.280
Because everyone realizes at some point&nbsp;
in their lives that they are only human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:06.480
and that they cannot do everything by themselves&nbsp;
on their own, that they cannot control everything.&nbsp;

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:13.500
They get unexpectedly ill - they lose their&nbsp;
job - someone close to them dies - they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:20.040
do not win the sports match they worked so&nbsp;
hard for - war breaks out in their country.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:28.320
Covid hits and the list goes on.
In moments like these, lying to yourself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:32.220
and telling yourself, man, I have confidence&nbsp;
and everything will work out the way it should.&nbsp;

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:38.820
It's kind of like hoping in nothing.
Because you have no power to change reality.&nbsp;

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.400
The reality that is outside of you.&nbsp;

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.920
There are things in this&nbsp;
world that you cannot control.&nbsp;

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:50.160
I have seen this so many times - men who try&nbsp;
to act and think and try to force themselves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:54.600
to actually believe themselves - their own&nbsp;
lies - that they are more than they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:58.560
and that by just thinking positively,&nbsp;
it will somehow change the reality.&nbsp;

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:02.100
And then when reality hits them in the&nbsp;
face, they are shocked and surprised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:06.960
and their whole world just crumbles.
You see that especially with young men&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:12.300
who have insecurities and they think that the&nbsp;
answer is trying to tell themselves that they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:16.320
alpha males and they try to puff themselves up.
Like with men in a boxing match.&nbsp;

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:23.340
They try to tell themselves I will not lose, I'm&nbsp;
the best, I'm the strongest, I'm great. I - I - I.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:32.340
And then that eye gets knocked out.
If not in that match, in a later match.&nbsp;

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:36.360
And also in life.
We are all mortal.&nbsp;

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.700
For some reason, a lot of us young guys - when&nbsp;
I used to be young - I used to think like that.&nbsp;

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:50.700
But over the years, I saw men die.
Strong men die right before my eyes.&nbsp;

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:56.760
And the way they died changed&nbsp;
my perspective of life.&nbsp;

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:02.040
They used to feel powerful -&nbsp;
ruling their own small world -&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:07.260
only to come to this inevitable moment.
To come to the end of their lives before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:14.220
they die, realizing they are weak.
Just a human whose time has come.&nbsp;

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:20.460
And they are only dust.
You know, this realization changed one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:27.660
these men that I knew completely before he died.
He used to be - I mean he was bigger than me - he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:32.520
used to be very arrogant and&nbsp;
man, just living for this world.&nbsp;

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:37.500
And puffed up and always when he walked into a&nbsp;
room, you know, he would take control of the room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:44.820
and trying to kind of force his way through life.
And, oh man, he changed.&nbsp;

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:50.280
I have never seen someone change&nbsp;
that drastically like this man.&nbsp;

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:55.800
When he came to realize the&nbsp;
truth of the world and himself.&nbsp;

00:11:55.800 --> 00:12:00.900
No one could tell this guy anything at all.
He was always right.&nbsp;

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.480
Me, I'm the man.
And now he comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:09.360
to the end of his life, weak, powerless.
He couldn't even drive himself or even go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.940
to the toilet by himself.
I had to help him.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:12.720
[Psalm 8:4]

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:28.200
Having God's confidence changes everything.
It makes you realize who you truly are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.920
your identity in Him.
You start to see the world differently.&nbsp;

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:35.640
You get different perspectives, helping&nbsp;
you to overcome challenges much faster.&nbsp;

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.500
Oh man.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:47.640
The person I used to be.
If I know - man - if I knew what I know now.&nbsp;

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:53.220
I would have been so much different.
Made so many better decisions.&nbsp;

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:58.380
The more you grow in God, the more&nbsp;
He changes you to become stronger.&nbsp;

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:04.080
In a sense you - you get weaker in your own&nbsp;
fleshly sinful nature - you get stronger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:10.260
through the Spirit in Him and you grow in that&nbsp;
confidence, and you see how He is changing you.&nbsp;

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:15.660
He's the potter, you are the clay.
You're becoming stronger, meaning your confidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:23.100
viewed in the right way grows far beyond normal&nbsp;
humans who are spiritually dead because their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:30.540
confidence is in temporary material things.
While you are anchored in God Himself.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:39.060
You finally start to understand your purpose.
You understand your true identity in Him.&nbsp;

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.440
God says:

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.700
[Jeremiah 17:5-8]

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:39.060
Do you get it?
This world can do what it wants to you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:44.340
but if your confidence is in God,&nbsp;
you will always have peace and joy.&nbsp;

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.220
It's like the tree.
You know, the rain can come.&nbsp;

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:51.420
The storms can come.
The sun can beat in the day, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:58.080
the roots are in the living water.
Your confidence, your roots are in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:02.160
living water which is the Holy Spirit.
God's Spirit that is within you.&nbsp;

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:06.240
Tapping into that unlimited power,&nbsp;
walking within the will of God,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:13.800
no one and nothing can do anything to you.
Because you are in Christ, and He guards you.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.880
[Proverbs 28:26]

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:29.340
You cannot trust the things of this&nbsp;
world that always let you down.&nbsp;

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:33.360
You cannot trust in yourself because you're&nbsp;
not perfect and you will always make mistakes.&nbsp;

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.480
And you cannot trust in other people&nbsp;
because they always let you down.&nbsp;

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.000
You can only trust in God.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.620
[Psalm 20:7]

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:51.600
[Proverbs 3:5]

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:07.560
[Psalm 118:8]

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:21.540
You see, placing your trust in God, relying&nbsp;
on Him instead of just relying on your own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:26.820
human abilities, man, it changes everything.&nbsp;

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:30.000
Because then you don't even care&nbsp;
about other people's opinions.&nbsp;

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:36.300
You only care about what God thinks of you and if&nbsp;
you're walking within His will because if you do,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:41.460
everything will work out the way it should.
Not only will it help you to fight your battles,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:46.080
but He will also give you peace,&nbsp;
while you fight the battles.&nbsp;

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:50.040
And those battles will come.
That is why He has given you the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:58.740
armor of God that you need to put on every day.
And if you do, you will always have peace and joy.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.240
[Isaiah 26:3]

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:17.280
Now, start to live in God confidence&nbsp;
and not in self-confidence.&nbsp;

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:22.800
Draw your strength from the&nbsp;
truth and promises of His Word.&nbsp;

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.040
And live it.
To live and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:35.280
overcome life's challenges with faith joy&nbsp;
and unshakable trust in His divine plan.&nbsp;

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:41.400
Now, if you want to grow stronger in God,&nbsp;
then please watch one of these videos here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.820
If you haven't subscribed, do so now so&nbsp;
you won't miss any of our future videos.&nbsp;

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:47.100
And I'll see you there.
And always remember,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:52.980
life is short, so don't waste yours.
Cheers guys.

